{
  "Pregnancy.Urta.Bulge": "<b>Your belly is more noticeably distended. You're pretty sure it's Urta's.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Urta.Distended": "<b>Your stomach is painfully distended by your pregnancy, making it difficult to walk normally.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Urta.FullTerm": "<b>Your belly protrudes unnaturally far forward, bulging with the spawn of one of this land's natives.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Urta.Heavy": "<b>Your belly is large and very obviously pregnant to anyone who looks at you. It's gotten heavy enough to be a pain to carry around all the time.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Urta.Kicking": "<b>The unmistakable bulge of pregnancy is visible in your tummy, and the baby within is kicking nowadays.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Urta.Larger": "<b>Your belly is larger than it used to be.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Urta.Round": "<b>It would be impossible to conceal your growing pregnancy from anyone who glanced your way. It's large and round, frequently moving.</b>"
